EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Aha, there you are!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0007:000A:}}The big star!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Happy birthday, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I know I space out on a lot of stuff,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but I would never forget your
birthday!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I sent something to your house,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} so
keep your eyes peeled for it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ecco {{TAG:000E:0006:040069006C0004006C006100}} protagonista di oggi!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Buon compleanno, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}So che a volte sono uno smemorato,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma non potrei mai dimenticarmi
il tuo compleanno!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti ho fatto recapitare un regalo!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Fossi in te, terrei d'occhio la posta,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Happy birthday, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Who knows{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} what sorts of surprises
might be in store for you today?
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}left one for you in your mailbox, {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
so check it out later, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Happy birthday, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Are you going to eat{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} lots of cake{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
today?
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}I wonder if there's anything I can do{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
to make my next birthday come
sooner...

You were born{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} during a leap
year, right?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, this year isn't a leap year,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} so
we're celebrating today!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Happy birthday,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
I left you something in your mailbox,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
so check it out later, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
Tú naciste en un año bisiesto
de esos, {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿no?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues como este año no toca,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡vamos a celebrar tu cumple hoy!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Muchas felicidades,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Te he dejado un regalo en el buzón,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
que lo sepas, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
Sbaglio{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} o sei nat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} in un anno
bisestile?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, visto che quest'anno ha solo
365 giorni,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} celebriamolo oggi
il tuo compleanno!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Auguroni,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ti ho spedito un regalo per posta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dai un'occhiata dopo, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:001D:}}So di essere un giorno in anticipo,
ma gli auguri te li faccio lo stesso,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Visto che quest'anno non è bisestile,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
che ne dici di festeggiare oggi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Buon compleanno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti auguro cento di questi giorni,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Si no me fallan las cuentas,
hoy es tu cumple, ¿no, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Qué fuerte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oye, y si los años
"vejestorios" estos solo son uno
de cada cuatro...
¿Significa eso que te haces viej{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
más despacio?{{TAG:0003:001D:}} ¡Qué envidia!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sbaglio o oggi è il tuo
compleanno, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}E cade proprio il giorno in cui
sei nat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} È un evento speciale!
Succede solo ogni quattro anni!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Mitico!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Oh, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast doch heute
Geburtstag, oder?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Und zwar genau heute!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Das passiert nur alle vier Jahre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Da bist du sicher total aufgeregt.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Oggi è il tuo compleanno, vero?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Che bellezza!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tanti auguri a te, tanti auguri
a teee... Tanti auguri, {{TAG:0005:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
tanti auguri a teee! E la torta a me!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Da ist ja das Geburtstagskind!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Herzlichen Glückwunsch zum
Geburtstag, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ji, ji, ji...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Espero que te guste tanto
como a mí la paella de marisco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
